  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Color TV",
  "description": "The phrase 'color TV' is a racist trope implying that Black people are 'primitive' or 'not modern' because they 'don't have color TV,' suggesting they are less advanced or civilized. This stereotype is rooted in historical racial hierarchies and dehumanizing imagery.",
